open private fastDen fastDen_eq fastC fastC_eq fastKernel fastKernel_eq fastOld from ProximityPrize.SubmissionLower.Numeric6Defs
open private decode runLength rowValue rowStart sumFrom runValue from ProximityPrize.SubmissionLower.Numeric6AuxCert
